# Farming allocation

**Phase 1 (active):** start 60% core / 25% LP / 15% alpha. Monthly $200 → $120 / $50 / $30.

**~$100k+ book:** 60% core / 30% yield / 10% alpha. Sleeve APY aims 3–7% / 7–15% / 15%+ (lossy). Portfolio target **10–15%**.

Rebalance when a sleeve is **≥5pp** off target, or a hard-no fires. Split new cash with the phase monthly recipe, not the loudest APY.

Memecoin engine is outside these percentages.
